    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠγᾰδ-εύω</span></b> , Elean <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυγᾰδείω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Schwyzer</u>
			424.1
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>banish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.4.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					40.32
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦρ᾽ αὐτὸν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρωτα</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἐφυγάδευσαν ὡς ἡμᾶς κάτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristopho
					11.7
				</span></i>
			: opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστρακίζω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1288a25
			</span></i>; metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θῆλυ τοῦ βίου φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.4.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.32
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφυγαδευμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>live in banishment</i>, <i><span class="en">
